    "unique runtime test IDs resolved from insert generated keys, do not hardcode framework ID1 as normal role",
    "new non-login accounts created through real login endpoint; test provider exchange returns providerRunId to private registry",
    "TEST_CAR/supports TEST_INSPECTION; next business-day pickup slot; no real merchant",
    "station A location (110.943,22.354) nearby, route mapping fixed through test adapter with PICKUP_A/STATION_A keys",
    "customer rule totalFen34000 independent driver rule6500; both explicitly marked fixture",
    "fixture operation does not insert paid orders, successful handovers, confirmed statements or payment proofs"
  ],
  "identities": {
    "owner-a": "basic OWNER",
    "owner-b": "another owner",
    "driver-a": "apply then approved by Q flow, not implicit login role",
    "driver-b": "second driver",
    "station-a": "sys employee with A station",
    "station-b": "sys employee B noA",
    "operator-a": "PC A scope",
    "finance-maker-a": "payorA recorder",
    "finance-reviewer-a": "payorA distinct human-review persona",
    "operator-b": "B negative scope"
  },
  "cleanup": "Keep test run evidence; disposable volume recreation only explicit user approval. No public arbitrary SQL/reset endpoint.",
